# Global Retail Intelligence Platform

A production-style retail analytics platform that automates ETL workflows, data validation, analytics, and reporting using Python, PostgreSQL, and GitHub Actions.

---

## Project Structure

```text
global-retail-intelligence-platform/
├── config/
├── data/
│   ├── raw/
│   └── processed/
├── database/
├── docs/
├── reports/
├── scripts/
├── src/
├── tests/
└── .github/
```

---

## Dataset

This project uses the **Olist Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset**.

The dataset is **not included** in this repository to keep the repository lightweight.

### Download

Download the dataset from Kaggle:

https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/olistbr/brazilian-ecommerce



After downloading, extract the CSV files into:

```text
data/raw/
```

---

## Tech Stack

- Python
- PostgreSQL
- Pandas
- Git
- GitHub Actions
